["<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Jared Diamond on Leaders, Luck, and Irreplaceability environmental Kuznets curve natural experiments Dvorak keyboard\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-09-tyler-没有不可替代的领袖-只有不可替代的运气/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/2d90e9a992692a3e-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">52:19</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Conversations with Tyler</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0909</span></div>\n<h2>沒有不可替代的領袖，只有不可替代的運氣</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">戴蒙德說歷史上沒有不可替代的領袖，成吉思汗只是恰好生在兩千年來最溼潤的草原；但 Rachel Carson 和 Resnick 這類人，確實讓事情提前了十年二十年。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">領導力</span><span class=\"tag\">地理決定論</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"When will average people feel AI’s impact? Engels’ pause Navier-Stokes Millennium Prize Problem\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-09-interconnects-ai-对普通人是舍入误差-扩散要五十年-反弹却等不了/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/2ea9ccfe0923b7a0-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"I\"><span class=\"dur\">8:31</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Interconnects</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0909</span></div>\n<h2>AI 對普通人是舍入誤差：擴散要五十年，反彈卻等不了</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">工業革命給普通人便宜衣服和縫紉機，AI 目前只給普通人好玩的圖片和更好的搜索——好處太間接，而政治反彈來得太快。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 擴散</span><span class=\"tag\">公眾認知</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Who Grades the AI Models? | Ben Horowitz &amp; Rayan Krishnan held-out private benchmarks recursive self-improvement (RSI) reward hacking token maxing harness\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-09-a16z-公开榜单测不出模型真实能力-第三方评测才是刚需/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">39:45</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0909</span></div>\n<h2>公開榜單測不出模型真實能力，第三方評測才是剛需</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Llama 4 在公開榜單上表現驚人，在 Vals 的私有留出集上卻是不達標——自報成績和真實能力之間的裂縫，正在催生一個獨立的評測行業。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI評測</span><span class=\"tag\">基準測試</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"Meteorology (WEATHER &amp; CLIMATE) Encore with Marshall Shepherd Clausius-Clapeyron equation wet bulb globe temperature bombogenesis atmospheric river ENSO AMO\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-09-ologies-天气预报准确率-95-但没人相信它/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/6714d8dbd3a57d1f-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">1:16:07</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Ologies</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0909</span></div>\n<h2>天氣預報準確率 95%，但沒人相信它</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">氣象學家說預報三到五天內有 95% 準確率，公眾只記住被淋溼的那一次；氣候不是未來時，是現在進行時。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">氣象</span><span class=\"tag\">氣候傳播</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"How we built Grok Bot in a month | Roman Ugarte (SpaceXAI) MCP steering infovore unshipping\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-08-lennys-grok-bot-一个月做出来-小团队躲进山洞-大团队会拖没微决策/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/42cbfb013ec2988d-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"L\"><span class=\"dur\">1:22:43</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Lenny&#x27;s Podcast</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0908</span></div>\n<h2>Grok Bot 一個月做出來：小團隊躲進山洞，大團隊會拖沒微決策</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">把知識工作做進 Cursor 不是顯然錯誤，但用戶能聞出三套願景共用一塊屏——那是把組織架構圖直接發貨。所以 Grok Bot 從零開始，幾個人躲進山洞一個月。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>17</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI agent</span><span class=\"tag\">產品設計</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Sarah Longwell on How Democrats Can Defeat Trump focus group low-information voters Build Baby, Build\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-08-goodfight-特朗普的不可复制性-才是民主党真正的机会/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c75b9a8ba0dff85c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">The Good Fight</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0908</span></div>\n<h2>特朗普的不可複製性，才是民主黨真正的機會</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">特朗普的持久力來自幾十年電視名人身份，別人學不來；民主黨若把特朗普時代的教訓當成通用規律，就會在2028年重蹈2024年的覆轍。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">美國政治</span><span class=\"tag\">選舉策略</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"OpenAI Researchers on the Future of Mathematical Reasoning sphere packing linear programming bound spherical code sofic group Aldous–Lyons conjecture harness\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-08-a16z-数学家怕-ai-写出千页证明-结果它只写了-15-页/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:05:15</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0908</span></div>\n<h2>數學家怕 AI 寫出千頁證明，結果它只寫了 15 頁</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">人類反證一個關於隨機圖的猜想，用了 250 頁、還建立在另外 200 頁之上；AI 在群論內部十幾頁就證出了更弱的那個結論。AI 的數學證明普遍短而優雅，長證明反倒只有人類寫得出來。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">數學推理</span><span class=\"tag\">OpenAI</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"parent\" data-hay=\"Picky eating, protein, food dyes, and nutrition myths: What parents actually need to know with Jennifer Anderson ARFID rest and digest hyper palatable food health impact tiers\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-08-secureattach-孩子挑食别怪食物-先修关系-再谈营养/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ddcbe6658f0e30d7-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">58:48</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"parent\"><span class=\"src\">Securely Attached</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0908</span></div>\n<h2>孩子挑食別怪食物：先修關係，再談營養</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">餵養策略本身沒那麼重要，重要的是你怎麼執行；父母先照顧好自己的食物關係，才是對孩子最有效的干預。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">兒童營養</span><span class=\"tag\">挑食</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Walter Russell Mead - How America Keeps Winning - [Invest Like the Best, EP.490] Tech Hamiltonian info-structure Jacksonian soft blockade\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-08-ilt-让对手依赖你的体系-是美国赢了三百年的秘密/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/aa91f50130802ffe-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"I\"><span class=\"dur\">1:14:23</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Invest Like the Best</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0908</span></div>\n<h2>讓對手依賴你的體系，是美國贏了三百年的秘密</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">荷蘭、英國、美國輪番當老大，靠的不是封鎖而是讓對手把身家性命押進自己的海洋體系——等它們離不開航路與市場，切斷就成了戰爭之外最有效的殺手鐧。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">中美博弈</span><span class=\"tag\">海洋霸權</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"Ep 221 Electroconvulsive Therapy Part 2: A current conversation Catatonia Anti-NMDA receptor encephalitis Succinylcholine Retrograde amnesia Transcranial magnetic stimulation (TMS)\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-08-tpwky-ect-不是你想的那样-从密室到常规治疗的百年漂移/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/360c7ded98e41886-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">58:21</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">This Podcast Will Kill You</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0908</span></div>\n<h2>ECT 不是你想的那樣：從密室到常規治療的百年漂移</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">現代 ECT 是在麻醉和肌肉鬆弛劑下進行的程序，療效顯著，但有關記憶喪失的副作用證據仍不完全清楚，社會對此的誤解導致它被過度汙名化。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">精神科</span><span class=\"tag\">電休克療法</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"parent\" data-hay=\"288: How Do I Help My Disorganized Teen? executive functioning time blindness metacognition natural consequences\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-08-asklisa-孩子丢三落四不是懒-是前额叶还没长好/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/747ab52ea57af87e-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">37:18</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"parent\"><span class=\"src\">Ask Lisa</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0908</span></div>\n<h2>孩子丟三落四不是懶，是前額葉還沒長好</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">14歲男孩的前額葉要到25歲才發育完，所以丟三落四不是態度問題。真正的問題是：家長自己的執行功能也不夠用，卻要替孩子搭一套他根本撐不住的系統。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">青少年心理</span><span class=\"tag\">執行功能</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"parent\" data-hay=\"End of the Day Crazies With Kids party hat / professional hat yes time\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-08-unruffled-孩子放学回家就发疯-不是他变坏了-是他终于安全了/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/1a571492f353e90a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"R\"><span class=\"dur\">27:46</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"parent\"><span class=\"src\">Unruffled</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0908</span></div>\n<h2>孩子放學回家就發瘋，不是他變壞了，是他終於安全了</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">孩子把一天的壓力全部倒給最親的人，是正常且健康的；父母這時要戴的不是陪玩的「派對帽」，而是立規矩的「職業帽」，那才是真正的優質時間。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">育兒</span><span class=\"tag\">情緒調節</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"我們如何老去？從《前浪》窺見中國老年生活的真實圖景 意定監護 軀體化 失獨家庭 空巢老人\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-08-cn300980-纪录片导演说-没有典型的老年-只有一个个具体的人/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/bda8c0f9bba83da6-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"不\"><span class=\"dur\">1:09:37</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">不合時宜</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0908</span></div>\n<h2>紀錄片導演說：沒有典型的老年，只有一個個具體的人</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">拍了兩季《前浪》的範世廣說，大多數婚姻走到最後是不鹹不淡甚至不好的，白頭偕老是鳳毛麟角；我們最缺的不是故事，是錢，和把老人當具體的人看。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">老齡化</span><span class=\"tag\">照護</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"谷歌AI風雲15年：諸神黃昏——發明未來的人為何錯過未來？ Transformer TPU 強化學習 稀疏模型 思維鏈 NeoLab\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-07-cnf65bb3-谷歌发明了-transformer-却把大模型时代让给了-openai/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/216e9fe2cae1cec8-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"科\"><span class=\"dur\">2:24:18</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">科技這碗飯</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0907</span></div>\n<h2>谷歌發明了 Transformer，卻把大模型時代讓給了 OpenAI</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">谷歌手裡同時握著 Transformer、TPU 和最多算力，卻因為搜索廣告的包袱和兩支 AI 團隊的內耗，把語言模型這條最關鍵的賽道讓給了 OpenAI。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">谷歌</span><span class=\"tag\">DeepMind</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"Blowing Up Your Life jolt collateral jolt nuclear events divergent thinking convergent thinking three B&#x27;s\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-07-hiddenbrain-一次意外就能让你看清人生-但冲动辞职多半会后悔/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/bda02344d4b647e4-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"H\"><span class=\"dur\">1:26:21</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Hidden Brain</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0907</span></div>\n<h2>一次意外就能讓你看清人生，但衝動辭職多半會後悔</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">人生轉折點往往不是理性權衡的結果，而是一次意外事件把人踢出自動駕駛狀態；但研究顯示，衝動辭職多半會後悔，最聰明的反應有時是原地不動。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">職業決策</span><span class=\"tag\">心理學</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Six Impossible Episodes: Back-to-Court Substantial Disruption Test Establishment Clause reasonable suspicion probable cause corporal punishment closed-circuit recipients\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-07-stuffmissed-美国最高法院先给了学生宪法权利-后来又把搜包和体罚还给校园/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/88586eb98e196b1a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">41:15</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Stuff You Missed in History Class</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0907</span></div>\n<h2>美國最高法院先給了學生憲法權利，後來又把搜包和體罰還給校園</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">從拒絕向國旗敬禮到搜書包，六個判例逐漸畫出美國公立學校學生的憲法權利；最高法院一邊立下「學校不是極權飛地」，一邊承認體罰與合理懷疑搜包不違憲，權利邊界由此縮小。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">美國最高法院</span><span class=\"tag\">第一修正案</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"321. The Respect Effect: What Stereotype Threat Teaches Us About Communication stereotype threat churn disidentify\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-07-thinkfast-批评想被听进去-先给高期待与信任/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c3e35d57ca15b5b1-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">20:04</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Think Fast Talk Smart</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0907</span></div>\n<h2>批評想被聽進去，先給高期待與信任</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">批評想被採信，靠的不是先誇幾句，而是讓對方看到：標準是高的、你是有潛力的。實驗中只一句「標準高但你能達到」，黑人學生的改稿行動率就衝到最高。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">刻板印象威脅</span><span class=\"tag\">反饋溝通</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"367 | Jared Diamond on the Course of History and the Role of leaders natural experiment ANOVA regression to the mean dendrochronology\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-07-mindscape-希特勒死于1930年车祸-二战还会发生吗/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/d69097efcbd03611-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">1:17:15</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Mindscape</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0907</span></div>\n<h2>希特勒死於1930年車禍，二戰還會發生嗎</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Jared Diamond 用自然實驗回答「領袖何時重要」：CEO 大約解釋 30% 的利潤差異，而體育教練最大的作用不是戰術，是訓練球員別犯規。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">領導力</span><span class=\"tag\">歷史</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"Meritocracy, Exams, and the Knowledge That Matters (with Daisy Christodoulou) eight-legged essay far transfer near transfer identical elements mental discipline Northcote-Trevelyan Report\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-07-econtalk-拉丁文练不出外科医生-考试难-不如考得有用/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/f8da698e33560635-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"E\"><span class=\"dur\">1:06:17</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">EconTalk</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0907</span></div>\n<h2>拉丁文練不出外科醫生：考試難，不如考得有用</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">拉丁文練不出外科醫生：技能幾乎不遷移。如果認定「越難越能磨腦」，一國最聰明的人會被浪費在最無用的知識上——這就是清代科考的教訓。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">教育</span><span class=\"tag\">考試制度</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Can Open Source Keep AI Power From Concentrating? Attention is All You Need ensemble\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-07-a16z-ai-权力集中只是当下技术的结果-不是终局/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">8:05</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0907</span></div>\n<h2>AI 權力集中只是當下技術的結果，不是終局</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Transformer 靠海量數據和算力才聰明，所以權力集中在買得起數據中心的大公司手裡；但 Transformer 還不到十年，人類大腦就是小數據專家的存在證明。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">開源模型</span><span class=\"tag\">算力</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"Vol.234 宏觀漫談110｜全球流動性的困境與中國五類經濟主體的金融結構轉型（9.2錄製） Capex FOMO Mega 7\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-07-cn38ff4a-全球流动性见顶-上半年越激进砸-ai-的公司-越先被折价/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c8ab7cfc7806449c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"高\"><span class=\"dur\">1:27:15</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">高能量</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0907</span></div>\n<h2>全球流動性見頂：上半年越激進砸 AI 的公司，越先被折價</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">資本市場的上漲必須有新錢持續接盤。全球流動性已經露出見頂跡象，上半年最激進投 AI 的公司，正從被獎勵變為被折價。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">流動性</span><span class=\"tag\">AI資本開支</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Why Money Launderers Love $100 Bills seigniorage trade-based money laundering Vancouver model banknote paradox SAR (Suspicious Activity Report)\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-07-oddlots-央行不愿废除百元美钞-那是一笔-2-5-万亿无息贷款/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dbb9160e6d589beb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">54:31</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Odd Lots</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0907</span></div>\n<h2>央行不願廢除百元美鈔：那是一筆 2.5 萬億無息貸款</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">現金使用越來越少，流通中的美元卻創新高。央行有動力繼續印 100 美元紙鈔：這筆錢實質是美國政府 2.5 萬億美元的無息貸款，代價是給全球洗錢者提供便利。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">洗錢</span><span class=\"tag\">反洗錢</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Are Rumors of an Imminent Russian Attack Warranted? | Yaroslav Trofimov Article 5 Suwalki Gap Minsk-1 / Minsk-2 Operation Spiderweb\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-07-hiddenforces-俄罗斯陷在乌克兰-仍有余力对北约开新战线/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/2b4203c8f6331570-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"H\"><span class=\"dur\">49:44</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Hidden Forces</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0907</span></div>\n<h2>俄羅斯陷在烏克蘭，仍有餘力對北約開新戰線</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">俄軍在烏克蘭沒有取勝，但消耗戰喂出了世界最尖端的無人機步兵戰經驗；嘉賓認為它完全有餘力對北約發動一次有限試探，窗口就在特朗普任期的最後階段。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">俄烏戰爭</span><span class=\"tag\">地緣政治</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"parent\" data-hay=\"Why Your Preschooler Is Hitting, Biting, or Kicking (And What Helps) autonomy kindergarten readiness accommodation power-over model\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-07-parentmojo-孩子打咬踢不是坏行为-是在夺回身体自主权/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/70c340acb32275d2-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"Y\"><span class=\"dur\">21:01</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"parent\"><span class=\"src\">Your Parenting Mojo</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0907</span></div>\n<h2>孩子打咬踢不是壞行為，是在奪回身體自主權</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">別再問怎麼讓打人停止。三四歲孩子的打咬踢，常常是身體被成人幾乎掌控一切後，僅剩的喊出「我沒有發言權」的工具——給回一點選擇，行為才會減少。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">學齡前</span><span class=\"tag\">幼兒攻擊行為</span>\n</div></div></a>"]